adynamicsmooth audio filter (src/audio/adynamicsmooth.ts)

src/audio/adynamicsmooth.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_adynamicsmooth.c:
the sensitivity and basefreq options and their ranges, the per-channel
low1/low2/inz state zero-initialised at configuration (config_input), and the
filter_frame smoothing loop with its coefficient polynomial, evaluated in the
same double operation order. The pinned dblp format follows its
FILTER_SINGLE_SAMPLEFMT(AV_SAMPLE_FMT_DBLP).

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
Upstream file:libavfilter/af_adynamicsmooth.c
